  ('zcrm_1579374000007599066', 'WENDY', 'Cancelled', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Member Referral', 'Gena', 'Weir', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'GenaWeir29@gmail.com', NULL, '303-470-2912', NULL, NULL, '1972-02-29', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2017-05-15 15:48:09', '2025-08-08 14:52:05', 'Gena Weir', '7275', 'Arvada', 'CO', '80007', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:52:05', NULL, 'Patrick', NULL, 'Jillian', '6/24/2003', 'Marissa', '5/19/2005', NULL, NULL, NULL, '5-15-17 Super nice and patient. Was uncertain about Health Sharing and only needing an option for short time frame. Also wanted a major carrier like Anthem or Cigna. Had UHC through work but was laid off. Docs are Dr. Nuhfer, Dr. Peter Knott-80021. Wanted Dr. John Williamson but not in network-80218.  Came to me recommended by her brother Tim Brown (her brother) who works for Am Fam in P&C. All healthy, no problems. Worked ''til Feb. 28 th and got laid off with severance and time off paid out. So, paid til May 31st. Got new Cigna plan with hopes of new job as soon as possible. Works in Health Admin at high level.', 'Cigna', 'Cigna Vantage 6700 Bronze', '585', NULL, 'Health Insurance', NULL, '2017-06-01', 'Tim (Brown?) Her brother', NULL, 'No Add On Product', 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Converted', NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL