  ('zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'WENDY', 'Enrolled - 2021', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Other', 'Carolyn Hope', 'Clark', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'carolynhope@mac.com', NULL, '901-351-3603', NULL, NULL, '1957-05-13', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2017-06-01 11:56:31', '2025-08-08 14:52:05', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', '4608 Greenbriar Ct', 'Boulder', 'CO', '80305', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:52:05', NULL, 'Noah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5-30-17 She was a Big Wave Lead and was put on a pan outside of exchange by another broker. 
"Thank you for your info and instructions on setting you up as my broker. I just selected you. 

I wanted to give you some background info. I had a broker in Boulder but he made an error, he did not sign me up through the exchange for 2016 or 2017, he just signed me up through Anthem directly. I had to choose new plans each year since my plans were discontinued. I discovered the mistake when my accountant told me this year that I did not have the correct form to file for my insurance tax credit. I have only been in CO for three years. The first year I was signed up through the exchange. I payed to full amount each month then at tax time I got my credit. So he suggested I file an appeal to see if they could possibly help me sign up through the exchange at least for the remaining part of the year. Since I had been ill informed by my broker they opened up a special embroilment period for me and I was approved through the appeals process. My new plan will start on June 1st. My file is still open but should close soon I am told. 
I don’t think I need your help right now since everything seems to be in order, but later in the year if my plan gets canceled or laws change I may need it then. 

Thanks so much!
Hope"', 'Anthem', 'Anthem Core Pathway X Silver HMO 5300 but with CSR is 1000.  APTC should be $611.46 when applied. It''s not showing as applied to account yet.
